A||||5||jeffndebrus||anyone here used design one products?||||1||
Z||000000||jeffndebrus||11-03-2001||12:42 PM||||Just wondering how they are to work with?<BR>Was wondering if they could help me with a kit to make the 4.0 aurora (northstar) to work in my 85 se auto?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jay||11-03-2001||03:46 PM||||Design one is expensive but has great quality.  From the turbo kits I've seen they are very complete, and Kevin will take the time to talk to you.  Give him a call and see what he says.  If you get the Aurora stock tranny it is a relatively easy swap.  Try calling Howel, they did my wiring for my Northstar conversion (it is actually a Aurora harness).  You can find their number on my web page <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/jaygrande" TARGET=_blank>www.members.home.net/jaygrande</A> <BR>You'll also see what custom work has to be done.  Several of us on the forum have or are working on Northstars so help is just a key stroke away.<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig2_copy_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||avengador1||11-03-2001||05:07 PM||||Jay, when you installed your N* did you have to cut any of the sheetmetal in the enghine compartment or was it a direct bolt in? Thank you in advance for your answer.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||5
Z||000003||rogergarrison||11-03-2001||05:31 PM||||Ive got there turbo on mine. very very few minor problems in almost 90,000 miles. all bolt on and every part fit exactly like it was supposed too.||||reg||1
Z||000004||mikemck||11-05-2001||11:40 PM||||I am finishing up a Northstar installation using the Design One kit.<P>There is no need with it to cut any sheet metal in the engine compartment (other than removing misc. brackets and standoffs, etc.).  I did dent in the right shock tower a bit to gain a little clearance for the power steering pump.<P>It is a very tight fit with about 1/4" clearance some places.<P>I did remove the lower part of the trunk to gain space for an exhaust system.||||reg||1
Z||000005||grinthock||11-05-2001||11:43 PM||||Lothar's 2.8 Turbo GT has the design one kit, I hear it's complete and could be put on by a backyard mech, that's what it's designed for.  it's a complete kit.  BUT the stuff they have "seems" over priced but consider the engineering work to make such a good kit.  You wanna design it yourself?  Have fun, I guess that's the way I look at it.<P>If you are looking for info on the Aurora swap call RaceTech they are doing/did one and would be more than happy to help you over the phone  416-747-5728||||reg||1
